OL,3,GNEWSAGroup of 60 attacked pub with
OL,4,Afireworks, landlady says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA landlady said she locked customers
OL,7,Finside her pub for hours while a group
OL,8,Fof teenagers attacked it with
OL,9,Ffireworks.
OL,11,FSalford pub manager Paula, 61, said she
OL,12,Fand 30 customers hid out as "about 60
OL,13,Fteenagers" bombarded The Plough, in
OL,14,FCadishead, on Saturday.
OL,16,FPolice were called, and footage from
OL,17,Fthe incident, appearing to show doors
OL,18,Fbeing kicked and a bus driver being
OL,19,Fassaulted, has since been shared on
OL,20,Fsocial media.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
